and all existing command subclasses to accept StockList in their execute signature, preparing the architecture for dedicated stock commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":61,"deletions":10},"test-code":{"insertions":4,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"ba9d6bfd0967c07a72936a8cbf6a993bf8363e32","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refactor stock handling into OOP command classes","messageBody":"Extract procedural stock commands from Duke.java into AddStockCommand, RemoveStockCommand, and ListStockCommand. Route stock parsing through Parser.java and delegate stock display formatting to Ui.java.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":314,"deletions":197}}},{"hash":"311208a73ee0da2670369b63bea6b1e855c984c1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add unit tests for stock commands and stock UI","messageBody":"Add StockCommandTest to verify adding, updating, and removing stock entries. Add tests in UiTest to verify stock table formatting and notification messages.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":97,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"9537f84a0eff6eabfd541f8a52e4916a7eb4596e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix stock command prefix parsing and error hints","messageBody":"Update Parser.extractValue to support command-specific prefixes and format hints. Previously, extracting the price prefix for stock add did not delimit by q/, causing the quantity to be parsed as part of the price. Additionally, missing prefix errors now correctly display the stock command format instead of the product format. Add unit tests in ParserTest to verify parsing behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":32,"deletions":37},"test-code":{"insertions":32,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"db1f40b470e8c5c7811d7082c7cd832126a1b076","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Link stock management to catalogue products","messageBody":"Require products to exist in the catalogue before adding stock, throwing a SystemException if the product is missing. Directly update Product.setStock() when stock is added or removed to ensure the catalogue and stock list stay synchronized. Update unit tests in StockCommandTest accordingly.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":20,"deletions":39},"test-code":{"insertions":25,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"566b83e1b94ddcb8ae631fa94cc39bd8ffcd053a","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove unused parseField and outdated reuse tag in Duke","messageBody":"Remove the unused parseField helper method from Duke.java following the migration of stock parsing logic to Parser.java. Also remove the outdated //@@author BA-reused comment as the starter loop now follows standard project architecture rather than the external iP code.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":0,"deletions":28}}},{"hash":"ec3175771087d3afb72aaa775a56455d3b2b3a33","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge upstream/master into master","messageBody":"Resolve merge conflict in AddOrderCommand.java by integrating upstream assertions and logging while keeping the StockList parameter on execute.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"13e474d1a576f3f0430049bb7d6babb34947dd60","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #27 from DemiSushi/branch-view-sales","messageBody":"4.1 List Sales","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"e35e9c1a0f51a89c9a59b89e3f31953f3e2c2520","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #26 from DemiSushi/branch-generate-receipts","messageBody":"4.4 Branch generate receipts","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"6d9bcc2d830dba5a46cf78f3f148bff52407a378","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge upstream/master into master","messageBody":"Integrate sales listing (PR #27) and receipt generation (PR #26) from upstream. Resolve Parser and ParserTest conflicts, and adapt new commands to include the StockList parameter.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-14T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"eb59ab7c9074b461760fb2824d1eb47287ae59e5","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove price parameter from stock add command","messageBody":"Update stock add format from \u0027stock add p/PRODUCT a/AMOUNT q/QUANTITY\u0027 to \u0027stock add p/PRODUCT q/QUANTITY\u0027. Stock entries now inherit their unit price directly from the corresponding catalogue Product. Update Parser and unit tests accordingly.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":9,"deletions":17},"test-code":{"insertions":12,"deletions":11}}},{"hash":"cf9488fdd705b0e6c5834889ba0d24a06434d7ea","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions, logging, and defensive checks to stock commands","messageBody":"Improve defensive programming across AddStockCommand, RemoveStockCommand, and ListStockCommand. Add assertions for preconditions (non-null dependencies, valid positive quantities, non-empty product names), postconditions, and invariant checks. Add java.util.logging.Logger event tracking at INFO and WARNING levels for command auditing and debugging. Add comprehensive Javadoc comments and unit tests verifying assertion triggers.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":104,"deletions":6},"test-code":{"insertions":27,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"b1dabe8e43176c3e85cf5cf4a03d38617cfe0c30","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #48 from zechby/branch-ug-products","messageBody":"Add product catalogue section to the User Guide","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"ee938e07f464c29ed097093d353ff734de29d64d","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #47 from zechby/branch-product-assertions","messageBody":"Added assertions and logging to the product catalogue","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"de85e3d628b91f1f0edd448e280e293696453750","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add information about stock and stock command","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"ins